  "layout": {
    "$comment": "Screen geometry (8 px grid): inset 32 on every side, header row 48 at y 32, content from y 112 (656 x 576). gutter = space inside a group, group = space between groups. mv-* = the Media screen visual slot (the disc's place): right edge x, top y and height, in screen px. GitHub detail: a left column pr-col-w wide, the QR block at the right edge, checks in rows of check-row-h; section-gap = a section label to its rows. Toast: 656 x toast-h, padding toast-pad, the first at y toast-top (bottom position: ends at the bottom inset). Speaker sheet: panel from y sheet-top, inset on every side, rows sheet-row-h with a sheet-icon icon.",
    "inset": 32,
    "gutter": 16,
    "group": 48,
    "row": 48,
    "top": 112,
    "card-w": 320,
    "card-h": 280,
    "card-pad": 24,
